%description:
Tests the amount of data on a TCP Fast Open SYN. The first connection caches
the cookie and the MSS of the server (1024 bytes). Connection 2 sends 2000
bytes: its SYN carries the cached MSS less the largest option space (40
bytes), that is, 984 bytes (RFC 7413 section 4.1.3, as Linux does), and the ACK
that completes the handshake carries the next 1016 bytes.
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.tSend2=0.5s
*.cli_app.sendBytes2=2000B
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true
*.srv_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.srv_app.localPort2=2000

*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.501 A003] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125984(984) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP FastOpen(cookieLen=8)
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.503 B002] A.1001 < B.2000: A S 125500:125500(0) ack 125985 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.505 A004] A.1001 > B.2000: A 125985:127001(1016) ack 125501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
TcpTestNet1.srv_app: received 2000 bytes in 2 packets
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
